flowchart TD
  UI[One Semester shell / Action Center / Search / Workspace] --> API[Authenticated domain APIs]
  API --> PDP[Membership + capabilities + consent + classification]
  PDP --> Gate[Existing release + activation + flag evaluators]
  Gate --> Domain[Domain command services]
  Domain --> DB[Canonical data + revisions + provenance + audit]
  Domain --> Outbox[Transactional outbox]
  Outbox --> Worker[Idempotent workers / retry / DLQ]
  Worker --> Gate
  Worker --> Adapter[Approved SIS / LMS / campus / payment adapters]
  Adapter --> Recon[Authoritative receipts + reconciliation]
  Recon --> DB
  PDP --> AI[Policy-controlled AI gateway]
  AI --> Source[Authorized source retrieval]
  AI --> Broker[Bounded tools / exact confirmation / human authority]
  Broker --> Gate
  Domain --> Obs[Sanitized telemetry / alert / staffed support]
